{% extends "layouts/home.njk" %}
{% block body %}
            <section id="profile" class="profile" aria-labelledby="h-profile">
                <h2 id="h-profile" class="section-heading section-heading--on-accent">Profile</h2>
                <p class="profile__lead">
                    Designer and Frontend Engineer with 6+ years of experience in digital product, UX/UI and
                    frontend development, building on a longer background of 15+ years in graphic design,
                    identity and visual communication. I work at the intersection of design, technology and
                    systems, translating complex problems into product experiences, design systems and coherent,
                    maintainable frontend implementations. I've worked across UX/UI and development, led frontend
                    architecture and component systems for multiple products and, more recently, researched
                    human-AI collaboration and agent-based work.
                </p>
                <div class="chip-row">
                    <span class="chip">Design Systems</span>
                    <span class="chip">UX/UI</span>
                    <span class="chip">Frontend Architecture</span>
                    <span class="chip">Component Systems</span>
                    <span class="chip">WCAG 2.1 AA Accessibility</span>
                    <span class="chip">Prototyping</span>
                    <span class="chip">Human-AI Collaboration</span>
                </div>
            </section>

            <section id="projects" aria-labelledby="h-projects">
                <h2 id="h-projects" class="section-heading section-heading--accent">Recent projects</h2>

                <div class="projects">
                    <article class="project">
                        <h3 class="project__title">Design-to-Code and Human-AI Collaboration · Warp</h3>
                        <p class="project__meta">Personal project · 2026 · Angular, Knowledge Architecture, AI Agents</p>
                        <dl class="data-strip">
                            <div class="data-strip__item"><dt>Role</dt><dd>Design &amp; research</dd></div>
                            <div class="data-strip__item"><dt>Year</dt><dd>2026</dd></div>
                            <div class="data-strip__item"><dt>Status</dt><dd>Public</dd></div>
                            <div class="data-strip__item"><dt>Output</dt><dd>Methodology + repositories</dd></div>
                        </dl>
                        <p class="project__text">
                            Research into how much of the definition → design/prototyping → frontend implementation
                            flow can be delegated to AI agents, and under what conditions this can be done
                            reliably, traceably and reproducibly. Includes real design-to-code conversion tests on
                            Angular, with agents that had no prior conversation history, to evaluate replicability
                            and context dependency.
                        </p>
                        <p class="project__text">
                            I developed a staged methodology based on traceability, ambiguity reduction,
                            cumulative enrichment, versioning and validation gates, with explicit contracts
                            between layers; the tests identified the design-to-code specification contract as the
                            main bottleneck. Splitting research, documentation, testing and development across
                            multiple agents surfaced a second problem: keeping knowledge, decisions and
                            responsibilities coherent across instances with no shared memory.
                        </p>
                        <p class="project__text">
                            In response I built Warp, a Git-based knowledge architecture for maintaining
                            persistent responsibilities, interchangeable agents, explicit documentary authority
                            and automatic structural validation, critically contrasted against DDD / Bounded
                            Contexts, Data Mesh, ADR/RFC, IBIS, W3C PROV and Team Topologies.
                        </p>
                        <div class="chip-outline-row">
                            <span class="chip-outline">Angular</span>
                            <span class="chip-outline">AI Agents</span>
                            <span class="chip-outline">Knowledge Architecture</span>
                            <span class="chip-outline">Git</span>
                            <span class="chip-outline">Design-to-Code</span>
                        </div>
                        <div class="project__links">
                            <a href="https://github.com/gineslm/design-to-code" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer" class="icon-inline">design-to-code repository
                                <svg class="external-icon" width="13" height="13" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.5" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" aria-hidden="true" focusable="false"><path d="M15 3h6v6"></path><path d="M10 14 21 3"></path><path d="M18 13v6a2 2 0 0 1-2 2H5a2 2 0 0 1-2-2V6a2 2 0 0 1 2-2h6"></path></svg>
                                <span class="visually-hidden">(opens in a new window)</span>
                            </a>
                            <a href="https://github.com/gineslm/warp" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer" class="icon-inline">warp repository
                                <svg class="external-icon" width="13" height="13" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.5" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" aria-hidden="true" focusable="false"><path d="M15 3h6v6"></path><path d="M10 14 21 3"></path><path d="M18 13v6a2 2 0 0 1-2 2H5a2 2 0 0 1-2-2V6a2 2 0 0 1 2-2h6"></path></svg>
                                <span class="visually-hidden">(opens in a new window)</span>
                            </a>
                        </div>
                    </article>

                    <article class="project">
                        <h3 class="project__title">Accessible hybrid component library &amp; design system</h3>
                        <p class="project__meta">Laberit · 2025–2026 · confidential</p>
                        <dl class="data-strip">
                            <div class="data-strip__item"><dt>Role</dt><dd>Lead DS + frontend</dd></div>
                            <div class="data-strip__item"><dt>Year</dt><dd>2025–26</dd></div>
                            <div class="data-strip__item"><dt>Sector</dt><dd>Healthcare</dd></div>
                            <div class="data-strip__item"><dt>Status</dt><dd>Confidential</dd></div>
                        </dl>
                        <p class="project__text">
                            I led the definition, design and implementation of a design system and a hybrid
                            component library in Angular 18 and Ionic 8, with WCAG 2.1 AA accessibility
                            compliance, for a healthcare application ecosystem.
                        </p>
                        <div class="responsibilities">
                            <div class="responsibilities__label">Responsibilities</div>
                            <dl class="responsibilities__list">
                                <div class="responsibilities__row"><dt>Architecture</dt><dd>Primary and semantic token structure, accessibility criteria, component patterns and implementation standards for the whole ecosystem.</dd></div>
                                <div class="responsibilities__row"><dt>Client management</dt><dd>Validation of design criteria, resolution of product decisions and alignment with healthcare-sector requirements.</dd></div>
                                <div class="responsibilities__row"><dt>Knowledge transfer</dt><dd>Technical documentation, component usage guides and team training to ensure adoption of the DS as a shared standard.</dd></div>
                                <div class="responsibilities__row"><dt>Governance</dt><dd>Evolution model: criteria for adding, changing or deprecating components, version control and review process.</dd></div>
                            </dl>
                        </div>
                        <div class="chip-outline-row">
                            <span class="chip-outline">Angular 18</span>
                            <span class="chip-outline">Ionic 8</span>
                            <span class="chip-outline">Design Tokens</span>
                            <span class="chip-outline">WCAG 2.1 AA</span>
                            <span class="chip-outline">Figma</span>
                            <span class="chip-outline">Angular Signals</span>
                        </div>
                    </article>
                </div>
            </section>

